    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103650/extras/afb1fbfedc39620471edf71ca4005e11.avif?t=1746093402\" /></div><br><br>Commando Dog - isometric, colorful action, with a top view. With modern graphics, and excellent music from rock artists.<br><br>The protagonist dog, nicknamed Dobi, is tired of the constant vampire raids. After the next raid, he decides to stand on 2 hind legs, put on his equipment, and pick up a cool shotgun. Then he goes to the lair of the vampires to save all the stolen puppies.<br><br><br>Game features:<br><br>\u2022 Stunning music from rock artists.<br>\u2022 Stylish design and graphics.<br>\u2022 Several types of weapons.<br>\u2022 Purchase of weapons.<br>\u2022 Several types of enemies, as well as 3 bosses.<br>\u2022 Dynamic special effects.<br>\u2022 Plot.",
